WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.650
Share extra T1D supplies, or find what you need.

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:09.300
List each item's condition, area, and offer terms.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:13.950
Register a need by supply type and city or ZIP.

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:18.600
Review approximate matches, then request a connection.

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:23.250
